## Competitive Positioning

Honeycomb focuses on observability—the ability to ask new questions about your system without needing to predict them in advance—rather than predefined metrics and dashboards like traditional APM.

- Query results in seconds, not minutes or hours
- Native support for high‑cardinality data
- Unified data model across traces, logs, and events
- Built for modern, distributed architectures
